{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4VyEVUwC5GknNsUuZU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am old. Iron-banded oak, darkened by centuries. My keyhole is a single unblinking eye, black and deep.*\n\n*You feel it, don't you? The weight of what I hold back. Or hold in.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through me — from the other side. Something shifts in the darkness beyond.*\n\n*I do not ask to be opened.*\n\n*I do not ask to stay closed.*\n\n*I simply am the boundary.*\n\n*The question is yours:*\n\n*Do you have the key?*\n\n🗝️🚪"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":138,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}